Rips_CreatePreset
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
├── when entry cap is not a power of two
│   └── it should revert.
├── when entry price is below the minimum
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers is empty
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers exceeds max tier count
│   └── it should revert.
├── when a tier has min payout greater than max payout
│   └── it should revert.
├── when tiers are not sorted by count descending
│   └── it should revert.
├── when a tier has a zero payout count
│   └── it should revert.
├── when total payout count does not equal entry cap
│   └── it should revert.
├── when total payout pool does not equal entry cap times entry price
│   └── it should revert.
├── when fee percent exceeds FEE_BASE
│   └── it should revert.
└── when fee percent is at most FEE_BASE
    ├── it should store the preset configuration.
    ├── it should increment the next preset ID.
    └── it should emit a {PresetCreated} event.
